&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Customer Success team is made up of Account Directors&amp;nbsp; and Customer Success Managers who are passionate about helping our clients succeed. We partner with a diverse range of organizations, from Fortune 1000 companies to some of the largest financial institutions globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a team, we are committed to providing value to our clients. We take a consultative approach to solve challenges through our product, ensuring our customers have the right data to make informed decisions. We focus on retaining customers, maximizing product usage, and collaborating with the sales team to uncover growth opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a high-impact Account Director to own and expand relationships with our most complex and high-value accounts within the Corporate Life Sciences sector. You&#39;ll be the primary point of contact for a book of Fortune 1000 accounts—driving renewals, adoption, and growth. In this role, you&#39;ll be expected to collaborate with account executives, identifying new business opportunities to help expand our footprint within each client account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While key performance indicators include retention rate and the identification of growth opportunities, the responsibilities of Account Directors go much deeper. The team also extracts a wealth of knowledge from our clients, bringing that internally to product, marketing and sales teams in order to maximize the effectiveness of our business&#39; strategy and communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast and maximize retention rate across your book of business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase and drive adoption of AlphaSense solutions into other business units of existing clients to uncover new opportunities, exceeding monthly, quarterly and annual revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify revenue at risk in order to best position the company to prevent churn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Account Executives to identify growth opportunities within the book of business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the ins and outs of the business, roles, responsibilities, projects, performance metrics, etc. within our client base in order to more effectively: 1) communicate with users, 2) communicate with decision makers, 3) identify white space, 4) partner with AE to craft most compelling messaging to prospective users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships with users and key stakeholders to ensure AlphaSense is viewed as a business partner rather than vendor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold Business Reviews with key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent proactive outreach with material and information that’s relevant for our user base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as our boots on the ground and physical presence within each client (floor walks, lunch and learns, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as both the advocate for AlphaSense to the client, and the client advocate within AlphaSense&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquire value stories and product feedback from clients. Circulate internally to assist with product development, marketing, sales efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship-driven:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong ability to develop instant rapport with new people and you’ve demonstrated success at managing and growing relationships within Fortune 1000 clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A subject matter expert: &lt;/strong&gt;You excel at what you do and know how to succeed within your role -- this includes both internal and external relationship management as well as strong business acumen and commitment to effective processes and tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledgeable and experienced in Life Sciences: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience working with clients in the Life Sciences industry, including Pharma, Biotech, Medical devices and diagnostics - additional bonus for familiarity with competitive intelligence, business development and clinical and commercial strategy workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energetic and creative: &lt;/strong&gt;You possess a natural intellectual curiosity with the ability to learn and adapt quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand our business: We are a rapidly growing SaaS company and are incredibly passionate about our product. We are looking for individuals who understand best practices for client engagement within a SaaS environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Committed to delivering results: &lt;/strong&gt;You set the example for grit, work ethic, initiative, enthusiasm and commitment amongst your peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong communicator: &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll regularly be engaged with day-to-day users to C-level executives and that requires exceptional oral, written and presentation skills. You’ll need to distill and explain complex issues in simple terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AlphaSense Corporate Sales team is verticalized, with a focus on the world&#39;s largest companies across Life Sciences, Technology, Media and Telecom, Energy and Industrials, and Consumer Packaged Goods. The newly formed Global Accounts team sits at the intersection of our regional and strategic teams. It is built around multinational corporates with a material presence on both sides of the Atlantic, where a combined account strategy delivers the most value to our customers and company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Executives on the Global Accounts team work in cross-region pairs, with an Americas-based and an EMEA-based AE jointly owning a shared set of accounts. Together, you will build one territory vision, partner on account strategy and business cases, and drive adoption bottom up and top down across both regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced, entrepreneurial, and accomplished seller to join our Global Accounts team as an Account Executive based in EMEA. You will be the primary owner for a book of multinational accounts &lt;strong&gt;headquartered or led from EMEA&lt;/strong&gt; that have significant teams, users, and buying centers in the Americas. You will partner day to day with your Americas-based counterpart, who leads the accounts headquartered in the Americas and the regional relationships on the accounts you lead, to grow AlphaSense across the whole organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership, end-to-end role. You will combine a strategic account planning motion (executive relationships, business cases, multi-stakeholder and multi-region deal cycles) with the hands-on work of growing large accounts and opening new ones. You will proactively prospect into new accounts and business units, not just manage inbound interest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role is built on people. You will identify and develop champions across business units, functions, and regions, and equip them to advocate for AlphaSense internally. You will be expected to get in front of customers: onsite visits, executive briefings, and team workshops, in partnership with your Americas-based counterpart, are a core part of how we earn trust and accelerate deals. You will turn that access into results through disciplined execution: clear mutual action plans, tight follow-through on trials and next steps, and a regular rhythm of account reviews with your partner and leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and execution for your book of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA-led global accounts&lt;/strong&gt;, partnering with your Americas-based counterpart on the accounts they lead where your presence and relationships can accelerate the deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a joint account plan with your Americas-based partner for every shared account, aligned on stakeholders, whitespace, deal timing, and a single global business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive-level relationships and champions across Corporate Strategy, Competitive Intelligence, Business Development, M&amp;amp;A, and Investor Relations, and expand into new functions and business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your accounts through upsell, cross-sell, and new use cases, and open new accounts and business units alongside your existing book.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full sales cycle, from prospecting through demos, trials, and close, in partnership with our SDR, Product Specialist, and Account Management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately and build the pipeline needed to meet and exceed your quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert on corporate customer needs and use cases, market dynamics, the competitive landscape, and product differentiation within your vertical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and share product feedback from customers and prospects with the sales and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to travel regularly for customer meetings, onsite engagements, and team collaboration is an expectation of this role. Flexibility to travel as needed to advance opportunities, strengthen customer relationships, and drive revenue growth is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thinks strategically.&lt;/strong&gt; You put your time where there is real buying intent and access to decision-makers, and you build plans by working backwards from what success looks like for the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builds relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong record of account mapping, multi-threading, and building relationships with senior executives and champions across large, matrixed organizations. You can explain complex business data and concepts to a non-research audience and tell the story of present and future value to people at all levels. [Additional European language skills are a plus.]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grows accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; You have taken accounts from low five or six figures to much larger through expansion, cross-sell, and new use cases, ideally in a SaaS or comparable enterprise sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opens new doors.&lt;/strong&gt; You crack open new accounts and new business units while still running a book, through your own proactive prospecting alongside the support of our SDR and Marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brings grit and hustle.&lt;/strong&gt; You stay with it and deliver consistently, quarter after quarter. You are coachable, intellectually curious, and thrive where you can be creative to get things done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborates globally.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable sharing an account, a pipeline, and a plan with a colleague in another region, working across time zones and putting the account&#39;s outcome ahead of individual credit. You understand that the buyer in London, Basel, and New York may all be different, with different needs and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AlphaSense is the market leader in AI driven search and due to client demand, AlphaSense is expanding our Enterprise Suite Sales Team to lead top-down sales into the largest global enterprises.&amp;nbsp;Enterprise Suite securely enables clients to generate unique insights from a combined library of the client’s own qualitative intellectual property and AlphaSense’s trusted external content sets. This solution leverages AlphaSense’s market leading proprietary GenAI and LLM, to enable the client’s IP to be more discoverable and actionable. For further information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/platform/enterprise/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.alpha-sense.com/platform/enterprise/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven top-down seller with experience selling complex technical solutions (APIs, AI/LLM platforms, data infrastructure, or enterprise software) into the largest global enterprises, at both the technical and C-suite level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in technical conversations. You can discuss agentic architectures, MCP, authentication, security, and integration with developers and architects, and then connect it to business value for executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced selling into large corporates across industries such as technology, healthcare and life sciences, consumer and retail, energy and industrials, and professional services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seller who owns the opportunity from start to finish, including a technical evaluation or proof of concept.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at building relationships with stakeholders at every level, including C-suite and executive buyers, as well as IT, InfoSec, Legal, and Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in executive presence and communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined in sales process and pipeline management, with a track record of running long, multi-stakeholder enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced working closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, and Technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and open new Enterprise Suite opportunities at the largest enterprises, and partner with internal Account Executives and Account Managers to execute on account strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead opportunity qualification (Metrics, Economic Buyer, Decision Criteria, Decision Process, Paper Process, Identify Pain, Champions, and Competition), and run ongoing commercial conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run technical discovery and scoping with AI leads and developers. This includes whiteboarding sessions, solution requirements, and proof-of-concept design around use cases like workflow automation, unified chat interfaces, and proactive insight delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and drive mutual action plans that cover the business case, buying committee presentation, InfoSec and legal review, and contract approval through go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure value-aligned commercial proposals that combine platform access with AI credit consumption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across Sales, Application Specialists, Technical, and Product teams on implementation, client feedback, enhancement requests, and product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage weekly calls with key internal and external stakeholders on active and prospective opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as an industry, workflow, and AI-strategy expert, helping clients turn manual research into automated insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For base compensation, we set standard ranges for all roles based on function and level benchmarked against similar stage growth companies and internal comparables. In order to be compliant with local legislation, as well as to provide greater transparency to candidates, we share salary ranges on all job postings regardless of desired hiring location. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including candidate experience/expertise and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive benefits program, a generous commission plan with uncapped earning potential as well as equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$124,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$171,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
