&lt;p&gt;You’ll sell our GenAI-powered market intelligence platform to buy-side and sell-side financial services firms, helping investment professionals uncover trusted insights and make better-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to build your territory, own the full sales cycle and make a measurable contribution to our growth. We’re looking for someone who combines commercial ambition with thoughtful, consultative selling—and takes pride in earning clients’ trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proven seller:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You have a strong record in SaaS or investment technology sales, ideally serving financial institutions such as investment banks, asset managers, hedge funds, brokerages, private equity or venture capital firms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A consistent performer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You regularly exceed new-business targets and can demonstrate how you turn opportunities into revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A disciplined prospector:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You build your own pipeline and lead deals from first outreach through discovery, tailored demos, trials, negotiation and close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A trusted adviser:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You engage senior decision-makers confidently, understand their priorities and connect product capabilities to meaningful business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An accountable collaborator:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You take ownership, navigate complex buying processes and bring internal and external stakeholders together to move opportunities forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A curious communicator:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You ask insightful questions, simplify complex ideas and adapt your approach to each client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
