&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in a client-facing SaaS role (Customer Success, Sales Engineering, Product Specialist, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years leading high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of financial services workflows; expertise in investment banking, private equity, and hedge funds is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator with strong presentation skills and the ability to tailor narratives to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision-maker who uses metrics and insights to prioritize and measure success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment and enjoy building for scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
