&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with sales leadership to prioritize accounts, align team resources, and ensure we’re driving impact where it matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Build scalable playbooks, demo flows, and talk tracks for key personas, leveraging product usage data and GenAI adoption insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Enablement, Marketing, and Product teams to align messaging, share customer feedback, and roll out new initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
