&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Director, Compensation to lead AlphaSense&#39;s global compensation function: a results-oriented leader ready to own the full compensation lifecycle, while building a high-performing team and partnering closely with the VP, Total Rewards, Finance, Legal, and business leaders across the company. We envision this highly visible, high-impact role as a strong influencer with the business and the go-to person for all things Compensation, including base pay, short-term incentives, and long-term incentives (equity).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead AlphaSense&#39;s Compensation team and act as the primary owner of the company&#39;s compensation philosophy, structure, and programs. You will partner with the VP, Total Rewards on executive compensation, and serve as the owner and subject matter expert for compensation matters across the business, balancing the discipline required of a company approaching IPO with the pace and flexibility of high-growth tech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires prior experience scaling compensation functions at high-growth or newly public technology companies. A flexible, growth mindset, comfort with ambiguity and change, and successfully balancing operational excellence with a sense of urgency will be critical to success in the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Define AlphaSense&#39;s multi-year compensation roadmap in alignment with market positioning that scales with the business. Own and manage the global compensation philosophy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural Design.&lt;/strong&gt; Own and manage the global compensation structure across base, short-term incentives, and long-term incentives (equity), in alignment with job architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management.&lt;/strong&gt; Own and manage broad-based compensation programs end-to-end, including Annual and Mid-Year compensation review cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Compensation.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the VP, Total Rewards on the design, benchmarking, and administration of executive compensation programs. Prepare Compensation Committee materials in partnership with external advisors (e.g., Compensia), and support proxy and governance readiness as AlphaSense approaches IPO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advisory.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with People Business Partners, business leaders, and managers to design compelling, scalable compensation solutions by seeking to understand the desired outcome, sharing market expertise, and proposing solutions. Provide guidance on complex, high-visibility compensation matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence.&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct quarterly and ad-hoc analyses to ensure external competitiveness, internal equity, and legal/pay-transparency compliance. Monitor market trends and ensure survey participation is completed to maximize our available benchmarking data set (e.g., Radford, Compa).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Communication.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop training and communication tools that help managers and employees understand AlphaSense&#39;s compensation philosophy, programs, and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Talent Acquisition on new-hire offers and with PBPs on internal mobility and promotion guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology &amp;amp; Program Administration.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the People Systems team on Workday configuration for compensation cycles, and with Payroll and Equity teams to ensure accurate transmission of payment and award data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; Build, coach, and develop a high-performing global Compensation team, fostering a culture of ownership, operational excellence, and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prior experience at a high-growth or newly public technology company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;owning the full global compensation function&lt;/strong&gt;, including designing, recommending, implementing, and administering compensation programs across base pay, short-term incentives, and equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;managing a team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive compensation experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including exposure to Compensation Committee cadence and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &lt;strong&gt;managing multiple compensation cycles in Workday&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong problem-solving and data analysis skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with comfort synthesizing data across multiple sources to support decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated cross-functional partnership&lt;/strong&gt;, building trust and alignment with Finance, Legal, and People Business Partners on shared, high-visibility decisions&lt;/li&gt;
