&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team in Waterford&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Waterford office is home to over 50 talented professionals dedicated to delivering Expert Insights as part of our AlphaSense + Tegus Operations team. Located in the heart of Waterford, our office is a dynamic hub where collaboration, intellectual curiosity, and client-focused research drive everything we do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We take pride in our diverse and highly skilled team, bringing together a mix of backgrounds and perspectives to produce high-quality insights for our clients. At Tegus, we foster a culture of excellence, continuous learning, and teamwork—all while making sure we enjoy the journey. Whether it&#39;s team outings, office socials, or just celebrating wins together, we believe that great work happens when people genuinely enjoy working with one another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate Traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AlphaSense+Tegus, we seek individuals who embody GRIT—those with a Growth Mindset, who are Respectable &amp;amp; Coachable, driven to make an Impact, and who thrive as a Team Player. If you resonate with these qualities, we’d love to get to know you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A Growth Mindset means embracing challenges, seeking feedback, and continuously learning. Being Respectable &amp;amp; Coachable requires humility, active listening, and openness to feedback. Impact comes from taking ownership, driving results, and making meaningful contributions. And as a Team Player, success is about collaboration, trust, and supporting one another. We champion these values by providing opportunities for growth, a collaborative environment, and the resources needed to achieve ambitious goals. If you have GRIT and are ready to make an impact, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunities in Waterford&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Waterford office is a growing hub for Expert Insights and Operations, offering exciting career opportunities across various functions. Whether you&#39;re an experienced leader or just starting your career, we provide a dynamic and collaborative environment where you can make an impact.&lt;br&gt;Here are some of the roles we hire for in Expert Insights: Analyst Development Representative, Client Research Manager, Operations Manager, Training Manager and People &amp;amp; Talent team roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Make an Impact?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join our talent community, hear about exciting career opportunities, and get tailored job recommendations based on your interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to Hear More?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contact us and let’s figure out together if we can find a common path. Tell us about yourself and your background in your own words.&lt;br&gt;Our recruitment typically consists of two rounds of interviews where you will meet our team and learn more about working at AlphaSense+Tegus. You will be given the opportunity to show your skills and ask us questions. The purpose is to get to know each other better.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Team:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Revenue Operations team at AlphaSense drives productivity and improves efficiency for our account executives, account managers and sales development reps. We create and implement operational reporting &amp;amp; analytics, improve processes, and enable strategic initiatives that impact the revenue organization.&amp;nbsp; At our core, we are a dynamic team of highly driven self-starters who are passionate about operations and thrive in a fast paced, challenging environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Manager within the Revenue Operations team to serve as the senior on-the-ground RevOps partner for our Singapore-based Sales organization, developing key enabling tools, streamlining processes and creating actionable reporting across the region. In this role, your responsibilities would include data analysis, reporting, sales process optimization and providing recommendations to regional and global Sales leadership on where to focus and drive impact. As the sole Sales Operations presence in Singapore, you will operate with a high degree of autonomy - building the credibility to influence senior Sales leaders directly, while partnering closely with a Global RevOps leader based in London to balance regional priorities with global consistency. Success in this role requires fluency across three lenses: the strategic (shaping territory, tooling and process decisions that will hold as the region scales), the operational (running the regular cadence of reporting, forecasting support and QBR execution), and the tactical (resolving the day-to-day issues that keep the Sales team moving) - often in the same week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimize Sales Operations processes to ensure scalability and fit for our international Sales organization, adapting global standards to regional realities where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Singapore and broader APAC Sales Leaders to drive business planning through data-driven analysis and actionable insights, and lead the execution of the regional sales strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Quarterly Business Review (QBR) process for the region, including working with leaders to create and refine templates and prioritize Asks of the Business coming out of QBR meetings from both leaders and individual contributors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, refine and identify areas of opportunity across our sales technology stack, processes and workflows that will enhance productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and implement new sales tools that are specific to APAC needs, working in partnership with Global RevOps to assess fit and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Singapore and APAC territories in partnership with on-the-ground Sales leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Insights and BI teams to dive deep within data and ensure Sales teams are following processes to collect the right data and insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and support a regular cadence of business reporting needs and SFDC dashboards, tailored to the priorities of regional Sales leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate the needs of a scaling APAC Sales organization and be proactive in delivering the tools, processes, strategy and analytics that are needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic thought partner to regional Sales leadership on initiatives relating to Revenue Operations, including territory design, sales processes and go-to-market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent APAC&#39;s operational needs into global RevOps forums, and represent global priorities credibly to local Sales leaders - translating in both directions rather than simply relaying messages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage priorities across daily, weekly and monthly horizons independently: triaging day-to-day requests from the Sales team, running the weekly forecasting and reporting cadence, and stepping back monthly and quarterly to assess whether current process and tooling will hold as the region scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercise judgment on what to resolve locally versus what to escalate to Global RevOps leadership in London, using concise, decision-ready communication to bridge the time zone gap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8-10 years of experience working with an international revenue organization and playing a key role in driving productivity for Sales Operations, ideally with direct APAC market experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operations professional with a passion for driving productivity, improving processes and using new technology to drive revenue at a high growth B2B SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional collaboration skills, with the ability to influence, align and work with senior Sales leaders and global teams based outside your home region, including across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as the sole Sales Operations presence in a region, building trust and credibility with senior stakeholders without a local team to lean on, and confident holding a position with senior leaders on process and data integrity while remaining a genuine partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, and the ability to work in a dynamic, fast-paced and fun environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to think strategically, act tactically and write effectively - and to move fluidly between the two, often within the same day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative problem solver that identifies new and innovative ways to drive sales productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to interpret data and derive actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail - with no local team to catch what you miss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the B2B sales process and the tools it takes to succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Manager, IT Service Delivery owns the day-to-day technology experience for AlphaSense employees across their region and is the bridge between global strategy and local execution. You will lead the regional service desk teams, own service performance and incident response, and make sure the region runs autonomously — but not independently — within the global IT service delivery framework.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is based in London and carries responsibility for EMEA, plus escalation coverage for APAC (Singapore and India) during the overlap between regions. You are the final regional escalation point before the Global Director, and you will partner closely with Security, Information Engineering, Business Applications, and Integrated IT. It is an opportunity to shape how a fast-growing, AI-first company delivers IT support to hundreds of employees across time zones.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Delivery &amp;amp; Operational Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional service delivery performance, including SLA compliance, ticket queue health, first contact resolution, and ticket aging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and prioritize the service desk queue; reassign work as needed to ensure consistent response and resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional Incident and Major Incident management: lead response, drive stakeholder communications, run post-incident reviews, and track corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final escalation point for complex support issues before Global Director involvement, with the goal of reducing escalation volume to global.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure white-glove support for executives and other high-visibility stakeholders, handling sensitive requests with discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Coverage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and mentor regional Team Leads and Support Analysts; set clear goals, run regular 1:1s, and conduct performance reviews and development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adequate staffing and follow-the-sun coverage across time zones; manage schedules, capacity planning, and workload balancing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional hiring: define role needs, partner with Recruiting and People Ops, interview and select candidates, and recommend regional hiring plans to the Global Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a collaborative, inclusive team culture that rewards knowledge sharing and continuous improvement; grow future leaders through the Regional Lead model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle, Hardware &amp;amp; Vendor Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee regional employee onboarding and offboarding, including new-hire orientation support and coordination with People Ops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee regional hardware lifecycle — procurement, deployment, retrieval and refresh — in line with global hardware and ordering standards, using approved procurement partners and asset-management tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage regional vendor performance (resellers, logistics, and support providers); escalate contract and commercial issues to the Global Director when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and manage regional service desk costs, and contribute to budget planning, forecasting, and procurement look-ahead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy Translation &amp;amp; Process Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate global IT policies, standards, and tooling into practical regional procedures; implement them locally and keep them documented, audited, and current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with regional labor laws and data privacy regulations (for example UK/EU GDPR and applicable APAC requirements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement and automation, including AI-assisted triage and self-service, runbooks, and a healthy knowledge base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead change management for regional rollouts so users and the service desk are prepared before changes go live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security, Risk &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to global security policies; support compliance activities for Information Security and Data Privacy (such as SOC 2 and ISO 27001 evidence collection).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the regional response to security or privacy incidents in partnership with Security, Infrastructure, and Application teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and report metrics on service performance, customer satisfaction (CSAT), and improvement opportunities; present regional updates and strategy in leadership forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote the IT Service Desk with senior management as a core business asset, and coordinate with stakeholders across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the APAC and North America regional leaders to maintain clean, documented handoffs and consistent global standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Program Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver regional projects end to end — scope, timeline, budget, risks, and status reporting — such as office launches, moves, and closures; tooling and automation rollouts; and hardware refresh cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track projects in the team&#39;s project tools and present status, blockers, and strategy in global IT leadership forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional partners (Security, Information Engineering, Business Applications, Integrated IT, People Ops, Finance) to keep projects on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in IT operations, service desk, or end-user services, including 3+ years leading teams with direct people-management experience (hiring, coaching, performance management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in multi-country, multi-time-zone environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of ITIL and ITSM practices: incident, major incident, problem, and change management; SLA management and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead through outages and escalations — calm, decisive, and clear in communication at all levels, including executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data privacy regulations (such as GDPR) and working with Security and compliance partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain complex technical topics to non-technical stakeholders; excellent written and verbal communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of the modern corporate IT stack, such as ticketing/ITSM (Jira Service Management, Freshservice, or Zendesk), Okta or Azure AD, Google Workspace, MDM (Kandji, Jamf, or Intune), macOS and Windows administration, and video conferencing/AV (Zoom, Google Meet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience: planning, delivering, and reporting on multi-stakeholder IT projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business skills: budget and vendor management, change management, process improvement, and stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITIL 4 Foundation or higher; HDI, CSM, or CompTIA A+ certifications; PMP, Prince2, or Agile/Scrum project management certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-assisted service desk tooling and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a fast-growing, hybrid, or global workforce, including office launches or relocations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating hardware procurement and global logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role provides coverage across EMEA and APAC and requires non-standard hours: typically around 6–7 AM to 2–3 PM UK time. You must be reliably available when Singapore and India teams need escalation decisions, and available for overlap with US leadership (around 3 PM UK / 10 AM ET). Flexibility is available on days when APAC coverage isn&#39;t needed; consistent availability for escalations is essential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Occasional travel to regional offices is expected, for example for team onboarding, office launches or moves, and leadership meetings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regional SLA compliance and reduced ticket aging and backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regional CSAT and first contact resolution trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced escalation volume to global.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective incident and major-incident management (time to restore, communication quality, and follow-through on post-incident actions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team health: staffing coverage, retention, engagement, and analyst development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects delivered on time, on scope, and within budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation, audit, and compliance readiness for regional processes.&lt;/li&gt;
