&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Remote US&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;Senior Director, Corporate Strategic Sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Consulting Sales team partners with the world’s leading consulting, advisory, and professional services firms, from global strategy houses to specialized research and advisory practices. These firms rely on AlphaSense to accelerate research, sharpen client recommendations, and deliver faster, better-informed answers across industries. Within Corporate Sales, our Professional Services &amp;amp; Consulting organization is responsible for both net new and expansion business, driving new logo acquisition while deepening AlphaSense’s footprint within existing customers. The Enterprise pods focus on the largest and most complex consulting logos, building executive-level relationships and driving firm-wide adoption of AlphaSense across practices and regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced, entrepreneurial, and accomplished enterprise sales leader to join our growing Consulting Sales team as a Pod Leader. You will lead a pod of two Account Executives while owning a portfolio of AlphaSense’s most strategic consulting and professional services accounts. Reporting to the Senior Director, Corporate Sales - Consulting, you will set the strategy, coach and develop your AEs, and lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles that result in six- and seven-figure SaaS partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a player-coach, this role combines owning and driving large enterprise deals with leading the strategy and execution of your pod and its cross-functional partners. You will build executive-level relationships with partners and practice leaders, craft compelling business cases, and guide firms through practice-by-practice and enterprise-wide deployments of our platform. This is a high-activity, high-accountability role that includes a meaningful volume of personal outbound prospecting into your accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with partners, practice leaders, and senior decision-makers &lt;/strong&gt;to shape how consulting firms use market intelligence to serve their clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead global expansion efforts &lt;/strong&gt;across multi-office, multi-practice organizations in collaboration with teams across regions and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and grow a team &lt;/strong&gt;while being part of a high-growth, AI-driven SaaS company that is rapidly becoming the standard for market intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Accomplished Sales Leader: &lt;/strong&gt;You have experience owning a large book of new business and expansion within enterprise or global accounts, ideally in consulting, professional services, or research and advisory firms, with a strong track record of overachievement in SaaS using value-based enterprise selling to close six- and seven-figure deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Player-Coach: &lt;/strong&gt;You have led, mentored, or formally managed sellers, and you enjoy raising the performance of others through hands-on coaching, deal inspection, and leading by example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You co-create a vision with your customers and work backwards from what success looks like to drive growth and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Executive Communicator: &lt;/strong&gt;You influence senior leaders and build champions in partnership-driven organizations, and you can explain complex concepts to audiences from Analysts to Managing Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with Volume: &lt;/strong&gt;You operate in environments where consistent outbound activity, including cold calling, is part of your daily rhythm, and you see proactive outreach as core to how you work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Leader: &lt;/strong&gt;You inspire and lead cross-functional partners to execute on a greater vision, and you enjoy getting into the details of a deal to find a path to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter: &lt;/strong&gt;You drive pipeline through your own efforts, in addition to the support of our SDR, Marketing, and Account Management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectually Curious: &lt;/strong&gt;You know the right questions to ask and how to uncover business challenges at all levels of an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative and Coachable: &lt;/strong&gt;You are open to feedback, committed to constant improvement, and motivated to build a high-performing, inclusive team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop a pod &lt;/strong&gt;of two Global Enterprise Account Executives, setting clear expectations, coaching on deal strategy, account planning, and executive engagement, and building a bench of future leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own strategy and end-to-end sales &lt;/strong&gt;for a portfolio of global consulting and professional services accounts, leading practice-by-practice and firm-wide deployments of AlphaSense across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and execute a vision and strategy &lt;/strong&gt;to align your team and cross-functional partners and grow your pod’s book of business through new logo acquisition, upsell, cross-sell, and new product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build executive-level relationships &lt;/strong&gt;with partners, practice leaders, and senior decision-makers, and support your AEs on the most complex, high-value deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become an industry expert &lt;/strong&gt;on consulting and professional services buying dynamics, use cases, competitive landscape, and product differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive pipeline &lt;/strong&gt;through personal prospecting plus ABM campaigns and prospecting plans built with SDRs and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast accurately &lt;/strong&gt;using CRM and analytics tools, and help your team build the pipeline needed to meet or exceed quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Account Management &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure customer health throughout the contract term and to identify opportunities for expansion and executive relationship building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition &lt;/strong&gt;to hire and onboard top-tier Account Executives, and champion a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into the Big Three, Big Four, or boutique consulting and advisory firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to research professionals in a fast-scaling SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For base compensation, we set standard ranges for all roles based on function and level benchmarked against similar stage growth companies and internal comparables. In order to be compliant with local legislation, as well as to provide greater transparency to candidates, we share salary ranges on all job postings regardless of desired hiring location. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including candidate experience/expertise and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive benefits program, a generous commission plan with uncapped earning potential as well as equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$215,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
