&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Cloud DX team owns the outer loop of software development at AlphaSense, everything from the moment code is pushed to source control to the moment it reaches production, for ~400 engineers distributed across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve built a strong delivery foundation with automated pipelines, GitOps workflows for both code and infrastructure, and a self-service developer platform that hundreds of engineers ship through every hour. Now we&#39;re taking it to a new scale. Our next ambitious goals take us from dozens of production systems to hundreds, running hundreds of microservices across hundreds of Kubernetes clusters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the role for the person who architects that next generation. We&#39;re looking for a Principal Engineer to work with our team to shape and deliver the architecture for how AlphaSense builds, configures, and safely ships software into a growing fleet of independent production environments expanding into new regions and isolated deployments without multiplying operational cost or slowing product teams down. Progressive delivery, canary deployments, automated rollbacks, trunk-based development, and GitOps are the direction we&#39;re actively building; at Principal level you&#39;ll define what best-in-class looks like here and bring dozens of teams with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role with organisation-wide influence. It requires deep operational and software engineering skill, and the ability to set technical direction across timezones with Engineering leaders, Security, and very senior engineers across many teams. You&#39;ll shape the engineering practices a global organisation depends on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who genuinely embraces AI tooling in their day-to-day work, appreciates the productivity value it brings, and is motivated to push that further both in their own practice and by helping embed AI-assisted workflows into the SDLC for the wider engineering organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the CI/CD and configuration management architecture across our production fleet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make spinning up a new production environment a templated operation, not a project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define reference architectures with performance profiles tuned per target cluster scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve version skew and release cadence across environments moving at different speeds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the progressive delivery standard: canary, automated rollback, safe-by-default releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the paved paths that let product teams ship anywhere without platform knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery end-to-end and drive pipeline reliability, speed, and predictability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve our Internal Developer Portal and the self-service experience around it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Cloud Platform, Security, and Compliance on the controls delivery must satisfy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction across the org and mentor Staff and Senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed AI tooling into delivery workflows for lasting productivity gains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Platform Engineering focused on CI/CD at companies with 250+ engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning and operating a CI/CD platform at admin and architecture level, including security, configuration, and enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in GitOps and declarative configuration at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to design and operate delivery systems at large scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on production-quality software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for progressive delivery practices: canary deployments &amp;amp; automated rollbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud-native architectures and Kubernetes-based platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for using AI to improve engineering velocity, quality, and developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills and ability to influence across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stood up a new production regions or isolated deployments end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in both product software engineering and platform engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of RBAC, OAuth, and compliance (SOC 2, ISO 27001, GDPR)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For base compensation, we set standard ranges for all roles based on function and level benchmarked against similar stage growth companies and internal comparables. In order to be compliant with local legislation, as well as to provide greater transparency to candidates, we share salary ranges on all job postings regardless of desired hiring location. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including candidate experience/expertise and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may also be offered a performance-based bonus, equity, and a generous benefits program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$246,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$339,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
