&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical escalation point for production issues, reliability failures, and systemic risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers, shape technical culture, and raise expectations for system design and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to long-term technical strategy while remaining hands-on with critical implementations&lt;/li&gt;
