&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the short- and mid-term roadmaps for AlphaSense&#39;s private markets, shareholder, and deals content, aligning with business objectives and client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the long-term Financial Data vision by building a deep understanding of client personas (e.g., analysts, bankers, corporate development professionals) and their diligence, deal-sourcing, and ownership-analysis use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously assess content gaps across private markets, shareholder, and deals data, and prioritize sourcing and coverage improvements to close them.&lt;/li&gt;
