&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Product Manager to own and define how our financial data is surfaced through search and agentic capabilities across the AlphaSense platform. In this role, you&#39;ll sit at the intersection of our vast financial datasets and the systems that make that data discoverable, screenable, and actionable for end users and AI agents alike. You will be responsible for understanding how financial content is structured, indexed, and ranked so that it can be reliably surfaced through search, screening, and agentic workflows, defining the product experience that makes our data foundation a trusted input for both human analysts and AI-driven research.&lt;/p&gt;
