ves at AlphaSense are fundamental to the success and growth of our business. You will focus on driving new business by sourcing, establishing and building relationships with Fortune 1000 executives or investment professionals over the phone, by email and through social outreach. The SDR role at AlphaSense will provide you with the foundational expertise you need to not only excel in the role today but our training and development program will help to propel your career into a quota-carrying sales role&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
