&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven Engineering Leadership: Strong track record of managing and growing high-performing teams of senior and staff engineers, with a passion for developing technical leaders and aligning engineering objectives with business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Enterprise Scale Experience: Seasoned background in designing, building, and operating high-throughput, low-latency distributed systems (specifically handling complex routing, caching, queueing, or rate limiting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Technical Thought Leadership: Ability to deeply engage in high-level architectural discussions, provide constructive technical direction, and deliver high-impact feedback during architectural reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strategic Communication: Exceptional communication and partnership skills to align diverse engineering, product, and executive partners across the R&amp;amp;D organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Modern Tooling &amp;amp; AI-First Mindset: Active embrace of AI tools in developer workflows, with an expectation for the team to leverage AI in their toolchains to maximize engineering velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Relevant Tech Stack Experience (Nice to Have):
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience in the applied AI space or working with frameworks and tools such as LangChain, LangGraph, LiteLLM, or OpenRouter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with orchestrators and proxies like Temporal, Envoy, or similar enterprise-grade gateway technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with Python, Java, and highly distributed caching/queueing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
