&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Foster a high-performance culture of technical excellence, predictable delivery, and career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;High-Scale Operations &amp;amp; Scaling: Own the strategy and architecture of our enterprise AI Gateway - currently processing up to 1 Trillion LLM tokens per week with a projected 10x growth surge driven by agentic workflows (such as SuperAnalyst) - while ensuring high availability, sub-millisecond routing, caching, queueing, and robust fallback mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Multi-Vendor Orchestration: Strategically guide the integration, evaluation, and management of 6+ major LLM vendors and 50+ distinct models, optimizing for latency, cost, and reliability across different providers.&lt;/li&gt;
