&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Customer Success Operations is a critical leadership role within our Revenue Operations team, owning the operationalization of our roadmap and strategic customer projects while also shaping the tools, systems, and processes that let Customer Success scale. You&#39;ll be the go-to partner for CS leadership on program design, execution rigor, and cross-functional delivery, act as the senior escalation point when something breaks, and manage a Senior Analyst supporting our deployments along the way. This role is perfect for someone who enjoys turning ambitious programs into scalable, repeatable motions and wants a direct hand in how we run Customer Success operationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Success - Revenue Operations team at AlphaSense drives productivity and improves efficiency for our account managers, CSMs, implementation specialists, support specialists, and leadership. We create and implement operational reporting and analytics, improve processes, and enable strategic initiatives that impact the revenue organization. At our core, we are a dynamic team of highly driven self-starters who are passionate about operations and thrive in a fast paced, challenging environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Bring broad, cross-functional fluency across customer success, account management, and adjacent go-to-market functions to set direction for how Customer Success Operations partners with the rest of the business. Exposure to pre-sales and application specialist functions is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program &amp;amp; Process Operationalization: &lt;/strong&gt;Define and continuously improve the operating model, cadence, and governance for our roadmap of strategic customer projects, and optimize existing Customer Success processes to ensure scalability as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Set the strategic framework for how core Customer Success metrics, including NRR, GRR, and usage KPIs, connect to business outcomes, and use that framework to inform program investment, prioritization, and executive reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Tool Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify opportunities across our Customer Success tool strategy, spanning systems like Salesforce, Gainsight, Clari, Gong, and Tableau, and partner with senior leadership on investment priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firefighting &amp;amp; Escalation: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for operational issues, whether a broken workflow, data discrepancy, or urgent tooling issue, and drive fast, durable resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QBR Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the Quarterly Business Review process end to end, building and refining templates with leaders and prioritizing the Asks of the Business that come out of QBRs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with CS leaders, Product, Sales, Support, Finance, BI, and Revenue Operations to align on priorities, gather requirements, and deliver on cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Repeatability: &lt;/strong&gt;Decide which programs are ready to scale and in what order, ensuring the playbooks and standards behind them hold up as coverage expands from a handful of accounts to full strategic segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with the Manager, Customer Success Operations on the KPI trackers, dashboards, and impact reporting that make each program measurable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own accountability for the trustworthiness of CS reporting as it scales, ensuring the QA and governance practices behind it, source of truth, hierarchy integrity, field accuracy, hold up under executive level scrutiny, and escalate material data integrity risk before it reaches leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage and develop the Senior Analyst, Customer Success Operations: set priorities, coach, and elevate their work from tactical execution to insight-driven impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
