&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a client-facing technical role, such as solutions engineering, solutions architect, sales engineering, working with large enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at open-ended discovery and asking insightful questions before recommending a solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at translating technical details into terms business stakeholders care about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on engineering experience, such as a software engineer or working on projects that show you can write and debug code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of REST or GraphQL APIs, identity protocols such as OAuth 2.0, SAML, and SCIM, and at least one cloud platform (AWS, Google Cloud, or Microsoft Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in ambiguous, high-growth environments and can deliver for clients and solve new problems on your own while our playbooks and enablement are still being built.&lt;/li&gt;
