&lt;p&gt;This is a Staff Engineer role with real breadth. It requires both operational and software development skills, the ability to lead projects and the need to collaborate with Engineering leaders and very senior Engineers across dozens of teams. You will be instrumental in setting the architectural roadmap for our Cloud Platform, ensuring the scalability and performance align with AlphaSense&#39;s rapid growth.&amp;nbsp;We&#39;re looking for someone who genuinely embraces AI tooling in their day-to-day work, appreciates the productivity value it brings, and is motivated to make our infrastructure ever-more AI friendly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Extremely experienced in Kubernetes and its various components, containerisation and AWS cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of running Kubernetes and Cloud based production SaaS systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
