&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and evolution of a major area of the entity data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design systems that ingest and serve large volumes of heterogeneous vendor data at scale with high reliability, freshness, and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
