&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AlphaSense is seeking a Vice President of Communications to lead the company’s global external reputation and influence strategy and strengthen AlphaSense’s leadership in AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Chief Marketing Officer, the Vice President of Communications will lead AlphaSense’s communication strategy to drive brand awareness, share of voice, and thought leadership at this critical stage of the company. This individual will oversee both internal and external communications and will work closely with the executive team and cross-functional leaders to support the company’s growth objectives, manage crisis communications, and enhance the brand’s narrative across key stakeholders, including customers, investors, and the media. The VP of Communications will also be responsible for AlphaSense’s prestigious Media Access Program that brings hundreds of reporters access to our platform resulting in thousands of media exposures. The VP of Communications will also be responsible for leading, developing, and mentoring a high-performing communications team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communications Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Develop, execute, and lead a comprehensive global communications strategy aligned with AlphaSense’s OKRs, brand story, and values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PR/Media Relations&lt;/strong&gt;: Oversee media relations strategy to increase AlphaSense’s visibility and share of voice in key markets and sectors. Oversee and manage key agency partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communications&lt;/strong&gt;: Advise and support the entire executive team, including the CEO, on external engagements, media interviews, speeches, written content, as well as internal communications, ensuring clarity and consistency in messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Communications&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure clear, engaging, and consistent communication across the organization, identifying the right cadence, channels, and messaging to motivate and engage employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and lead a high performing communications team, providing guidance, feedback, and development opportunities to foster their growth and ensure alignment with overall communications strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crisis Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead crisis communication efforts, providing clear and decisive leadership to mitigate risk and protect AlphaSense’s reputation during sensitive situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Creation&lt;/strong&gt;: Oversee the development of high-quality written content from the company and the executive team, including press releases, blogs, and social media posts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish metrics to measure the effectiveness of comms initiatives, ensuring alignment with business objectives and quickly adjusting strategies as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Access Program&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead the team responsible for our highly impactful MAP program that brings together hundreds of influential reporters to leverage AlphaSense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyst Relations&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead our world-class AR function, overseeing the AR leader and team and the strategy behind tier 1 analyst firms like Gartner and Forrester, to sustain AlphaSense’s position as the clear leader in major analyst evaluations like the Gartner Magic Quadrant and Forrester Wave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investor Communications &amp;amp; IPO Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with Finance, Legal, and Investor Relations to shape AlphaSense’s financial narrative and oversee communications planning leading up to an IPO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience (12+ years) in leading corporate communications during periods of hypergrowth, transformation, or crisis in a senior leadership role, ideally in a technology or SaaS company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of global external communications strategy to strengthen visibility, differentiation, and leadership. Relevant experience within AI is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led a team through an IPO, including building and executing the media strategy; employee communications planning and execution; and partnering with investor relations and the executive team for all steps leading up to an IPO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to distill complex business concepts into clear, compelling narratives and multi-channel communication strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with an ability to capture the voice of the leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in crisis communications and reputation management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, hypergrowth environment, with strong leadership and people management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in partnering with C-suite executives to develop strategic communications that align with corporate goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High EQ with the ability to communicate across a broad range of audiences and levels and to build and nurture cross-functional relationships—all with a high degree of professionalism, empathy, and respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the financial services industry, current enterprise technology, and AI landscape.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For base compensation, we set standard ranges for all roles based on function and level benchmarked against similar stage growth companies and internal comparables. In order to be compliant with local legislation, as well as to provide greater transparency to candidates, we share salary ranges on all job postings regardless of desired hiring location. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including candidate experience/expertise and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may also be offered a performance-based bonus, equity, and a generous benefits program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$340,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$445,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
